.TH MARBOR\-SCHEDULES 1 "2026-08-17" "marbor dev" "Marbor Manual"
.SH NAME
marbor\-schedules \- manage time\-of-day warmup/unload/drain/undrain automations (P\-A2-03)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B marbor schedules
[action] [args] [\fIflags\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
manage time\-of-day warmup/unload/drain/undrain automations (P\-A2-03)
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B list
list schedules
.TP
.B create
create a schedule
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-action string
warmup, unload, drain, or undrain (required) (required)
.TP
.B \-\-node string
target node name (required) (required)
.TP
.B \-\-at string
time of day, HH:MM 24h server\-local (required) (required)
.TP
.B \-\-models string
comma\-separated models (required for warmup/unload)
.TP
.B \-\-days string
comma\-separated days 0=Sun..6=Sat (empty = every day)
.TP
.B \-\-enabled
enable immediately
.RE
.TP
.B patch <id>
update a schedule (only flags you pass are changed)
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-enabled
enable or disable
.TP
.B \-\-action string
warmup, unload, drain, or undrain
.TP
.B \-\-node string
target node name
.TP
.B \-\-models string
comma\-separated models (empty clears)
.TP
.B \-\-at string
time of day, HH:MM 24h server\-local
.TP
.B \-\-days string
comma\-separated days 0=Sun..6=Sat (empty = every day)
.RE
.TP
.B delete <id>
delete a schedule
.SH FLAGS
.TP
.B \-\-server
Admin API base URL (default "http://localhost:8080", env MARBOR_SERVER)
.TP
.B \-\-json
output machine\-readable JSON instead of a human table
.TP
.B \-\-username
admin username, used to log in (env MARBOR_USERNAME)
.TP
.B \-\-password
admin password, used to log in (env MARBOR_PASSWORD)
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmarbor\fR(1)
